damaged_code:
```rust
// Anemic entity containing no business logic
pub struct Product {
    pub id: u64,
    pub price: f64,
}

// Mirror DTO used within the exact same process
pub struct ProductDto {
    pub id: u64,
    pub price: f64,
}

pub struct ProductAssembler;
impl ProductAssembler {
    pub fn assemble(p: &Product) -> ProductDto {
        ProductDto { id: p.id, price: p.price }
    }
}
```

fix:
Encapsulate the business logic directly inside the domain entity, and pass references to the entity (or lightweight read-only views) directly through internal layers without intermediate translation.
```rust
pub struct Product {
    id: u64,
    price: f64,
}

impl Product {
    pub fn apply_discount(&mut self, percentage: f64) {
        assert!(percentage > 0.0 && percentage <= 100.0);
        self.price -= self.price * (percentage / 100.0);
    }
}
```
